Description: A package designed for the preparation and visualization, in both static and dynamic formats, 
    of key diagnostics and results from JABBA model workflows. The package includes functions 
    for structuring data derived from model outputs, covering features such as hindcasts, 
    retrospective analyses, time-series visualizations, Kobe plots, prior and posterior 
    parameter distributions, sequential tests, hypothesis testing summaries, and overviews of 
    model performance and results.
